  "invariants": [
    "registering a LongHorizon goal record activates it by default",
    "the first liveness check is scheduled 60 seconds after activation",
    "startup reconciles every active goal that has no live liveness schedule and schedules its next check 60 seconds from reconciliation",
    "working or active targets skip the current occurrence and are checked again at the next interval",
    "appserver active and running normalize to working and are skipped without steering or queueing",
    "interrupted and idle targets receive a queue wake, never steer",
    "appserver interrupted and cancelled normalize to interrupted, and idle remains idle, before the queue wake",
    "appserver starting and stopping normalize to deferred states",
    "appserver systemError normalizes to failed",
    "appserver notLoaded normalizes to idle and resumes the thread before queue delivery",
    "an active writer during notLoaded resume is a definitive busy observation that defers the occurrence for a later retry",
    "appserver idle, interrupted, and cancelled targets queue a wake and explicitly start the queued submission when it remains pending",
    "appserver disconnected, failed, and unknown states fail closed without a queue wake",
    "the queue wake body names the goal file and instructs the target to continue executing the goal",
    "starting and stopping are deferred until a legal observation",
    "unknown, disconnected, and failed targets fail closed for the current occurrence and are checked again",
    "missing and dead targets fail closed and terminate the liveness schedule",
    "accepted, queued, delivered, executed, replied, and read are distinct evidence states",
    "uncertain delivery enters reconciliation and is never blindly retried"
  ],
